<title>UK: BNG sets 1.5 billion French franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 1.5 billion French franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    14.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.682   PAY DATE    14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.032    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX/AMST</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100+1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
